    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the thrilling world of <strong>Crazy Robot Ball</strong>, the ultimate turn-based football showdown! Take command of a team of high-tech robots, each with unique attributes designed to give you the edge in the battle for robotic football supremacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Highlights:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Turn-Based Tactics:</u>\u00a0Plan your moves strategically in this turn-based twist on traditional soccer. Anticipate your opponent\u2019s plays, set up the perfect pass, and unleash unstoppable shots on goal!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Customizable Robots:</u>\u00a0Assemble your dream team with robots that boast specialized attributes\u2014lightning-fast speedsters to dart past defenders, powerhouse strikers to blast through any blockade, and durable defenders to hold the line.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Four Unique Maps:</u>\u00a0Play across four distinct maps, each set in a unique location and featuring interesting layouts that add new layers of strategy. Adapt to varying terrain and field shapes to outwit your opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Game Modes for Every Player:</u>\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Freeplay Mode:</u>\u00a0Explore the game at your own pace. Experiment with lineups, perfect your strategies, and refine your skills without the pressure of competition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Tournament Mode:</u>\u00a0Test your mettle in a high-stakes championship. Face off against increasingly formidable opponents to claim the prestigious Golden Trophy and cement your legacy as a Crazy Robot Ball champion.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With vibrant arenas and dynamic play-by-play action, <strong>Crazy Robot Ball</strong> delivers an electrifying mix of strategy and excitement. Whether you're a casual gamer looking for a fun challenge or a tactical mastermind aiming to dominate the league, this game guarantees hours of thrilling gameplay.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the thrilling world of <strong>Crazy Robot Ball</strong>, the ultimate turn-based football showdown! Take command of a team of high-tech robots, each with unique attributes designed to give you the edge in the battle for robotic football supremacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Highlights:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Turn-Based Tactics:</u>\u00a0Plan your moves strategically in this turn-based twist on traditional soccer. Anticipate your opponent\u2019s plays, set up the perfect pass, and unleash unstoppable shots on goal!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Customizable Robots:</u>\u00a0Assemble your dream team with robots that boast specialized attributes\u2014lightning-fast speedsters to dart past defenders, powerhouse strikers to blast through any blockade, and durable defenders to hold the line.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Four Unique Maps:</u>\u00a0Play across four distinct maps, each set in a unique location and featuring interesting layouts that add new layers of strategy. Adapt to varying terrain and field shapes to outwit your opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Game Modes for Every Player:</u>\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Freeplay Mode:</u>\u00a0Explore the game at your own pace. Experiment with lineups, perfect your strategies, and refine your skills without the pressure of competition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Tournament Mode:</u>\u00a0Test your mettle in a high-stakes championship. Face off against increasingly formidable opponents to claim the prestigious Golden Trophy and cement your legacy as a Crazy Robot Ball champion.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With vibrant arenas and dynamic play-by-play action, <strong>Crazy Robot Ball</strong> delivers an electrifying mix of strategy and excitement. Whether you're a casual gamer looking for a fun challenge or a tactical mastermind aiming to dominate the league, this game guarantees hours of thrilling gameplay.</p>",
